WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.127
The Slow Horses.

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.797
Not typical MI5.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:10.385
What's going on?

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:12.721
Ex-service agent, found dead.

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:13.388
Cause of death?

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:14.681
Heart failure.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.683
Was in his sixties.
Smoked, drank.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:21.062
Well, I do all that.
Look at me. I'm in my prime.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:26.484
He left a note on his phone.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.945
Cicada.

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:35.326
Russian sleeper agents
embedded in British society.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:39.372
They've been reactivated.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.624
More people are going to die.

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:44.627
If you uncovered the
trail that quickly,

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:47.172
It couldn't have been
that well hidden.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.214
Thanks.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:56.097
Lamb, I do not need the Slow Horses
digging around in the past.

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:00.435
This feels too suspicious.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.311
What does that actually mean?

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:02.854
There's more to it.

00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:03.521
Stay back!

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.815
There has been an alert.

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:07.358
It's a traitor,

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:08.485
right at the top.

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:10.028
He has unfinished business.

00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:15.116
There is a plane

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:17.660
packed with explosives.

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:21.289
Thousands of people,
they're going to die.

00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:24.626
Sometimes the only way to
work out why a trap has been set...

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:27.045
is to walk into it. 

